# Runtime data and environments at any project depth
**/.runtime/
**/.cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/build/
**/dist/
# Acceptance outputs and generated workspace
/runs/
/workspaces/fermilink-validation/
# Upstream source checkouts are fetched at pinned commits by scripts/prepare_upstream.sh
/upstream/
*.py[cod]

# Package-local development checks
**/.checks/
